OL,3,AChildren among 109 dead after boat
OL,4,Acapsizes off Djibouti, UN says
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of migrants from the
OL,7,FHorn of Africa make the perilous
OL,8,Fjourney each year hoping to reach Gulf
OL,9,Fcountries for safety and work,
OL,10,Faccording to the UN agency.
